37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The monitor shows one room uses four times more than another.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That is a lot upfront.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
